ges.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3AGRS5BCWKEG2FN52HEWSZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　ビミョーにこの写真ブレてる？まぁいいや！\n　今日はめちゃめちゃナチュラルメイク眉毛描いてアイシャドウして終わり！お肌とまつげの休暇日😌最近毎日バッチリメイクしてたから今日は肩の力を抜いてナチュラルにしたよん！　　　ひとつのことに熱中してたら、タイトルの通り体感3時間で今日が終わりました。えぇえ？！もうちょっとだけ時間をくださいな⏰　　今日夜ご飯牛丼やってんけど、スージー富田さんも牛丼やってんて！まさか　偶然🌼　　　　　　明日は久々にギターの弾き語りでもメッセージで送ろうかしら🤔ふふふ\n何弾こうかな、？待っててな〜🎸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手洗いうがいガラガラひーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあね( ᐛ )٩و\n#425四つ子　\nラジオ体操日記1日目☀️2日目☀️3日目☀️4日目☀️5日目☀️6日目☀️7日目☀️1週間達成💮8日目🐒9日目🐒10日目🐒11日目🐒"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-44699":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はFNS歌謡祭さんに出演させていただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京サマーランドさんから『僕なんか』をお届けしました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV04J9B4NJ83CS8CE5GD1N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV05KB2Y4QAER0W4S3EB5K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV06KR84PCYJENY2FNN2AP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV07NC4MB3WGZ57GTAHC8D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京サマーランドに到着した時はまだ朝で、頭もまだ起きてなくて視界がぼやーっとしてた時に、あやちゃんの\n『なっちょー！！！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という声が後ろから聞こえて、なんだろう！って思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『なっちょ！！みた！？ハワイアンってあったよ！！なっちょじゃん！！ってなった〜！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って。私は全く気付かなかったのにそれをわざわざ教えてくれて朝からすっごくほっこり嬉しい1日でした☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやちゃんは今回の僕なんかグッズが出た時も、なっちょっぽくない！？影響されてるじゃんグッズまでって言ってくれたり、（ほんとは全然ソンナコトナくて、僕なんかのジャケット写真の衣装の柄をイメージしてます‼︎）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今だに大好き〜って言ってくれたりしてて、本当にそれがすっごく嬉しくて、なんか自分でも分からないけど涙が出そうになります！笑笑\nありがとう〜😭ってなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁあぁぁぁあんまりこの話をすると母に怒られるんだった、、笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『もうお腹いっぱい！自分の心の中にしまっておきなさい！って！！笑笑　　前をみて！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…って笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでこの辺に。。笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でもわかってるんです、、\nでもすごく嬉しかったので許してください‼︎\nく、く、く、くんちぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV08PD9Z7NGAJNDCXMENM2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい衣装でした〜☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHV09PRA6CF6WD36729GYSP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もリハーサル頑張るぞ〜👊‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サリマカシー🌺"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-39994":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやら３日後に失踪するらしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども。ポカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにやら櫻坂の菅井さまといっしょに、\n富士急で失踪するらしいですが、ポカはまだ元気です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細は「ポカ　失踪」でけんさくけんさく〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかのヤフーニュースデビューです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_0_r848fh8rh8f8tgh8th8.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて\n今日はライブに向けて、レッスン場で指示出し～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶付き、マイク付きのまさかのVIP待遇だったので、\n疲れたメンバーにはポカの背中まくらサービスを～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_1_fnirfirufuguthgut.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\nポカもメンバーと一緒にダンスをれんしゅー中なのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_2_friifhununufrufr.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めポーズはもさく中（ぼしゅー中）〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_3_djeijifjifuhfruhufrhu.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの仕上がりもさいこーなものになってますが、\nここ数週間のわーくあうとを通じて、ポカの体もだいぶできあがってきました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_4_jjd8j8hfrh7fh7rhf7r.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンプアップしたよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ迷っているおひさまのみなみなさま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"配信もあるので、ぜひチェックよろしくです～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0706_5_deidijinufurfiruhfwi.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"}}